## Bus factor: `lib/rack/attack/store_proxy`

Period: all history. Newest commit in the repo is 2026-04-14. Today is 2026-10-22, so no one has committed in the last 90 days. I counted "recently active" as a commit in the last 12 months, using author names from `git log`. Some people appear under more than one name or email, for example "Gonzalo", "Gonzalo R" and "Gonzalo Rodriguez".

### Project-level bus factor for this directory: 2–3

No single person owns more than about 40% of the commits. Gonzalo Rodriguez has the most, with 27 of about 70 commits. Many people have touched the directory, but only a few touched it recently.

### Who to ask

| Person | Commits | Last commit here | Why ask them |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Gonzalo Rodriguez** | 27 | 2026-03-09 | Main owner overall. He is the top contributor to `redis_cache_store_proxy.rb` (9), `redis_store_proxy.rb` (9), `dalli_proxy.rb` (5) and `store_proxy.rb` (7). He removed `NullProxy` most recently. |
| **Hye-jin Park** | 2 | 2026-02-20 | Added TTL to `RedisCacheStoreProxy` and `multi_increment`, `ttl` and `exists?` to `RedisProxy`. Ask about Redis behavior. |
| **Mei Tanaka** | 1 | 2026-02-09 | Only author of `dalli_accessors.rb`. Ask about the Dalli read/write/increment/delete extraction. |
| **Divya Rao** | 1 | 2026-01-28 | Wrote `MemoryStoreProxy`. |
| **fatkodima** | 4 | 2019-10-24 (last on `store_proxy.rb`) | Ask only if the others can't answer. They show up in most files, but I didn't check when their other commits were. |

### Who to ask for review

1. **Gonzalo Rodriguez** is the best reviewer. They know the most files and were active within the last 7 months.
2. **Hye-jin Park** for Redis changes, or **Mei Tanaka** for Dalli changes. Choose by which proxy you change.
3. Skip `github-actions[bot]`. It only made rubocop autocorrect commits.

### Risk areas

| File | Sole or main owner | Active? | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dalli_accessors.rb` | Mei Tanaka (1 contributor, bus factor 1) | Last commit 2026-02 | MEDIUM. The file is new, and `dalli_proxy.rb` depends on it. |
| `memory_store_proxy.rb` | Divya Rao (1 human contributor) | Last commit 2026-01 | LOW. The file is small. |
| `redis_cache_store_proxy.rb` | Gonzalo Rodriguez (9 of about 21 commits) | Active | LOW. Many contributors. |
| `store_proxy.rb` | Gonzalo Rodriguez, hakanensari, Vincent Boisard | Last commit 2019 | LOW. It has been stable since 2019. |

Nine files in `lib` and `spec` reference `StoreProxy` or `store_proxy`. I didn't check which of them depend on each proxy, so the dependent counts are not per-file.

### Recommendations

- **Before your PR:** ask Gonzalo about the proxy design, especially the recent `NullProxy` add and remove, and the TTL and Dalli accessor changes.
- **In the PR:** request Gonzalo plus one of Hye-jin or Mei, depending on the proxy you change.
